msgid "BitLocker was detected. Return to Windows, open Manage BitLocker, choose Turn off BitLocker, and wait until decryption reaches 100%. Suspending protection is not enough. Back up the recovery key, fully shut Windows down, then start the installer again."
msgstr "BitLocker was detected. Return to Windows, open Manage BitLocker, choose Turn off BitLocker, and wait until decryption reaches 100%. Suspending protection is not enough. Back up the recovery key, fully shut Windows down, then start the installer again."

msgid "Windows is hibernated or Fast Startup is active. In an Administrator Terminal run 'powercfg /h off', disable Fast Startup, then run 'shutdown /s /t 0'. Start the installer again only after Windows has fully shut down."
msgstr "Windows is hibernated or Fast Startup is active. In an Administrator Terminal run 'powercfg /h off', disable Fast Startup, then run 'shutdown /s /t 0'. Start the installer again only after Windows has fully shut down."

msgid "Windows did not leave this NTFS volume clean. Return to Windows, run 'chkdsk C: /f', allow every requested reboot to finish, then fully shut Windows down before trying again."
msgstr "Windows did not leave this NTFS volume clean. Return to Windows, run 'chkdsk C: /f', allow every requested reboot to finish, then fully shut Windows down before trying again."

msgid "This target would require moving critical NTFS MFT metadata through a currently unsafe upstream code path. Choose a larger Windows size or shrink the volume from Windows."
msgstr "This target would require moving critical NTFS MFT metadata through a currently unsafe upstream code path. Choose a larger Windows size or shrink the volume from Windows."

msgid "This NTFS volume is mounted or in use. Unmount it and rescan storage before continuing."
msgstr "This NTFS volume is mounted or in use. Unmount it and rescan storage before continuing."

msgid "This operation moves NTFS data and changes the GPT partition boundary. A power loss, failing drive, firmware fault or filesystem bug can cause permanent data loss. Back up all important Windows files before continuing."
msgstr "This operation moves NTFS data and changes the GPT partition boundary. A power loss, failing drive, firmware fault or filesystem bug can cause permanent data loss. Back up all important Windows files before continuing."

msgid "Verified now: plain NTFS, not mounted, not hibernated, cleanly shut down, and within the filesystem-reported safe range. The privileged installer will verify all of this again immediately before writing."
msgstr "Verified now: plain NTFS, not mounted, not hibernated, cleanly shut down, and within the filesystem-reported safe range. The privileged installer will verify all of this again immediately before writing."

